  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "**Logic: Third no. = [(First no. + Second no.) ÷ 2]**\n\n**Given:**\n\n**(6, 12, 9) →**\n\n​⇒ [(6 + 12) ÷ 2]\n\n​⇒ (18 ÷ 2) = 9\n\n**(16, 10, 13) →​**\n\n​⇒ [(16 + 10) ÷ 2]\n\n​⇒ (26 ÷ 2) = 13\n\nChecking the given options:\n\n**1. (15, 7, 11) →**\n\n​⇒ [(15 + 7) ÷ 2]\n\n​⇒ (22 ÷ 2) =** 11**\n\n**2. **(19, 24, 5) →\n\n​⇒ [(19 + 24) ÷ 2]\n\n​⇒ (43 ÷ 2) = 21.5\n\n**3. **(3, 14, 8) →\n\n​⇒ [(3 + 14) ÷ 2]\n\n​⇒ (17 ÷ 2) = 8.5\n\n**4. **(13, 38, 4) →\n\n​⇒ [(13 + 38) ÷ 2]\n\n​⇒ (51 ÷ 2) = 25.5\n\nHere, (15, 7, 11) is similar to the given number of pairs.\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option (1)\".\n\n56:T839,\n\nतर्क",
